{
  "name": "perf_gates",
  "saveFile": "minimal_colony.rws",
  "requiredMods": {
    "astryl.Circinus": "3773680130"
  },
  "description": "\u00a728 gate-memo measurement. Arms MapSky.AnyCondition -- the shared GameConditionManager chain walk under all four sky gates -- alongside the two narrow gates that sit on top of it and NightRadiance.VisualGlowFor, which is the caller that asks for both of them. The count on the WALK is the measurement; the counts on the gates are the control that says the callers did not stop asking. Wide tolerances on purpose: these pins exist to record a number in the report, not to assert one, because the value is what the A/B compares rather than a property to hold.",
